  "fullDescription": "The Star River font is a bold, whimsical display typeface that captures the magic of a midnight sky.\n\nWith its chunky, irregular letterforms and playful curves, this Star River typeface feels both adventurous and nostalgic. It is the perfect choice for children’s book covers, fantasy-themed branding, or animated movie titles where a sense of wonder is required.\n\nYou can enhance the Star River font by applying gradients or glow effects to mimic starlight, or pair it with a clean sans-serif for balanced editorial layouts. Whether you are designing party invitations or creative posters, this typeface brings a bold, energetic personality to every pixel.\n\nThis font is PUA-encoded, allowing effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters.",
